`,e.jsxs(a.p,{children:["High level, you create a rsgroup that is other than the ",e.jsx(a.code,{children:"default"})," group using ",e.jsx(a.em,{children:"add_rsgroup"})," command. You then add servers and tables to this group with the ",e.jsx(a.em,{children:"move_servers_rsgroup"})," and ",e.jsx(a.em,{children:"move_tables_rsgroup"})," commands. If necessary, run a balance for the group if tables are slow to migrate to the groups dedicated server with the ",e.jsx(a.em,{children:"balance_rsgroup"})," command (Usually this is not needed). To monitor effect of the commands, see the ",e.jsx(a.code,{children:"Tables"})," tab toward the end of the Master UI home page. If you click on a table, you can see what servers it is deployed across. You should see here a reflection of the grouping done with your shell commands. View the master log if issues."]}),`
